+    Any, Callable, ClassVar, Coroutine, Deque, Dict, Final,
+    FrozenSet, Generator, Iterable, Iterator, List, Mapping,
+    NamedTuple, Optional, Protocol, Sequence, Set, Tuple, Type,
+    TypeVar, Union, runtime_checkable,
+)
